  speakerName: VENDOR KYROS
  speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueText: 'Every journey eventually continues to another place.


    When
    leaving someone, you can say ''agpakada akon'' to say ''goodbye.''


    Use
    it when ending a conversation or parting ways.


    Listen carefully: agpakada
    akon.


    Now, try saying ''agpakada akon'' yourself.'
